      "source_name": "UNICEF, 27 August 2026",
      "note": "UNICEF's own press release: \"At least 17,000 children have been impacted by the devastating flash floods that tore through Nepal's Rasuwa, Nuwakot and Dhading districts on 26 August.\" Alice Akunga, UNICEF Representative to Nepal. Its title renders the same count as children in need of urgent humanitarian assistance; 18 schools were destroyed and 20 damaged."
    },
